{"t": 1794107699.9534764, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"issue_key": "PAY-618", "body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code` (repo `checkout`, Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q).\n\nCodes are now normalised before lookup: surrounding whitespace stripped, inner whitespace removed, and the result upper-cased (e.g. ` autumn24 ` and `Autumn 24` both become `AUTUMN24`).\n\nVerified locally against the failing inputs from the Android report; all variants normalise to `AUTUMN24`. The Sentry error was caused by the Android keyboard inserting spaces/lower-case, which previously passed through unchanged."}, "ok": true}
